WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.190
Use the correct school kiosk. Choose Staff and use your own staff code. Enter the work email if requested to identify the correct employee.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:26.380
Check the employee identity. Before a real punch, verify the returned name, classroom and current clock status. Never use another employee’s code.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:39.570
Clock once and verify. Choose Clock In or Clock Out as appropriate, then wait for the confirmed status before leaving the kiosk.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:52.760
Resolve a missing punch. Directors compare the time card with verified shift evidence. Use the time-card tutorial for an approved correction.

